Put your listing photos in this folder using these filenames (or edit the
`src=` paths in index.html to match whatever names you use):

hero.jpg        — main exterior shot at the top of the page
house-1.jpg      — living room
house-2.jpg      — kitchen
house-3.jpg      — primary bedroom
house-4.jpg      — bathroom
house-5.jpg      — back porch / exterior
land-1.jpg       — aerial or wide view of the land
land-2.jpg       — tree line
land-3.jpg       — open pasture / field
land-4.jpg       — barn or outbuilding

Until a file is added, that spot on the page shows a diagonal-striped
placeholder with the expected filename — so you can see at a glance what's
still missing.
